Description:
 linuxmuster-cli7 - Tools and CLI for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-cli7 (7.4.11) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * Listings are sorted in natural order: schoolclasses (names without
     any digit last), devices on room and hostname, lmngroups, printers
     and projects.
   * [users] "lmncli users ls" makes a single raw request and filters the
     roles itself, which is faster.
   * [packaging] Depends on linuxmuster-tools7 (>= 7.4.19).
